Based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee (the “Committee”) and the performance evaluation of P. N. Prasad, the Board of Directors of the Bank (the “Board”) at its meeting held on 25 April, 2026, approved the re-appointment of P. N. Prasad as an Independent Director of the Bank, for a second term of four years, with effect from 20 October, 2026 up to 19 October, 2030 (both days inclusive), subject to the prior approval of the members of the Bank.
Whilst considering the re-appointment of P. N. Prasad as an Independent Director, the Committee and the Board reviewed and confirmed that:
